WEBVTT

00:00:18.190 --> 00:00:22.230
Sadness is not abandon.

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:25.530
Anger is not hatred.

00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:29.040
Difference is not hostility.

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:32.440
Affection is not fixation.

00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:40.270
Your name is Kaguya, the one who seals Rudra.

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:49.950
<i>The white lotus flower blooms</i>

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:56.700
<i>The key to the bright night sky appears</i>

00:00:56.700 --> 00:01:02.300
<i>And now the hazy barrier fades away</i>

00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:07.580
<i>The unstoppable fate of time</i>

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:12.040
<i>The ever repeating link</i>

00:01:12.650 --> 00:01:19.650
<i>Madder red clouds are swallowed up by darkness</i>

00:01:19.650 --> 00:01:24.930
<i>Swirling desire gives it strength</i>

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:31.020
<i>A darkness that even provokes this love</i>

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:32.930
<i>Quick as lightning</i>

00:01:32.930 --> 00:01:36.000
<i>Illusions, show your true form</i>

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:41.240
<i>Sky, storm violently</i>

00:01:41.240 --> 00:01:46.850
<i>As the fang of steel shines with a golden gleam</i>

00:01:46.850 --> 00:01:56.850
<i>Why do people yearn for love so much</i> <i>their souls become dyed with crimson?</i>

00:01:57.360 --> 00:02:02.930
<i>Protect it to the end!</i>

00:02:02.930 --> 00:02:05.630
<i>Toward the light of the pure white lotus.</i>

00:02:05.630 --> 00:02:09.870
<i>AH... GARO</i>

00:02:09.270 --> 00:02:10.980
"GARO: CRIMSON MOON"

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:15.990
"VESSEL"

00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:21.520
The one who seals Horrors away within the red moon?

00:02:21.520 --> 00:02:23.690
What do you mean?

00:02:23.690 --> 00:02:27.990
--Well...
--Allow me to explain.

00:02:28.520 --> 00:02:31.530
Haruaki-<i>sama</i>. Why are you here?

00:02:31.530 --> 00:02:34.550
I will tell you the details at my dwelling.

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:38.730
Please listen with care.

00:02:38.730 --> 00:02:43.510
Kaguya is a Madou tool created by an ancestor of the Abe family.

00:02:43.510 --> 00:02:46.210
A created Madou tool?

00:02:46.210 --> 00:02:47.640
Correct.

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:51.180
And, as Kaguya has already mentioned,

00:02:51.180 --> 00:02:55.350
she was the seal that kept a Horror within the red moon.

00:02:55.350 --> 00:03:00.260
Then the broken seal that the Watchdog Center mentioned

00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:01.520
was Kaguya herself...

00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:04.390
Hoh. So you have already heard.

00:03:04.390 --> 00:03:06.590
Though your expression tells me

00:03:06.590 --> 00:03:10.700
that the Watchdog Center did not know that the seal was Kaguya.

00:03:10.700 --> 00:03:11.830
Am I right?

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:12.600
Yes.

00:03:12.600 --> 00:03:15.740
Then, if Kaguya is a Madou tool that seals,

00:03:15.740 --> 00:03:18.370
she can seal Rudra with that power!

00:03:18.370 --> 00:03:23.880
--Well...
--Unfortunately, it is not that easy.

00:03:23.880 --> 00:03:29.250
First, what do you know of the
Horror that was sealed in the red moon?

00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:33.020
It holds immense power and its name is Rudra.

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:38.690
Also, it is preparing to resurrect from within its vessel.

00:03:38.690 --> 00:03:41.100
So that is what you know.

00:03:41.100 --> 00:03:44.930
And what order did the
Watchdog Center give the Golden Knight?

00:03:44.930 --> 00:03:47.370
Stop Rudra's resurrection.

00:03:47.370 --> 00:03:51.970
Then, the order to eliminate
Rudra has already been given.

00:03:51.970 --> 00:03:52.870
Yes.

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:56.780
I was told to eliminate it before it completely resurrects.

00:03:56.780 --> 00:03:59.410
That can't mean...!

00:03:59.410 --> 00:04:01.950
No, impossible...

00:04:01.950 --> 00:04:04.390
It seems you have realized.

00:04:04.390 --> 00:04:08.090
The Watchdog Center has given you quite a cruel order.

00:04:08.090 --> 00:04:09.390
Please wait!

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:12.990
It's true that Seimei was different,

00:04:12.990 --> 00:04:17.730
but I cannot believe she would fall to the enemy so easily!

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:22.400
She was already cursed by Douma Houshi.

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:23.640
What did you say?!

00:04:23.640 --> 00:04:27.280
The darkness inside of her grew because of it...

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:30.800
And you have seen the result.

00:04:32.280 --> 00:04:37.080
Seimei is really the vessel...

00:04:37.690 --> 00:04:38.990
My apologies.

00:04:38.990 --> 00:04:42.160
I tried to resolve things before it came to this,

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:45.530
but I lacked the strength.

00:04:45.530 --> 00:04:49.630
And, Kaguya is currently unable to release her full power.

00:04:49.630 --> 00:04:55.430
Unfortunately, her power is closely linked to the resurrection of Rudra.

00:04:56.970 --> 00:05:01.640
Kaguya was a Madou tool created to seal Rudra.

00:05:01.640 --> 00:05:08.150
She responds to the immense power emanating from Rudra to activate her seal.

00:05:08.150 --> 00:05:12.150
So she can't use her powers unless Rudra resurrects?

00:05:12.150 --> 00:05:13.350
Correct.

00:05:13.350 --> 00:05:19.530
Unfortunately, she currently only has some healing and barrier powers.

00:05:19.530 --> 00:05:25.700
Though within her is the spell that can seal away Rudra's full form...

00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:30.910
She has no spell to seal it away when it is within a vessel.

00:05:30.910 --> 00:05:34.740
Then, is there any way to save Seimei, who has become a vessel?

00:05:34.740 --> 00:05:35.840
There is.

00:05:35.840 --> 00:05:39.010
However, it will take time to prepare.

00:05:39.010 --> 00:05:43.320
Will you protect Kaguya for a short time?

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:44.810
I understand.

00:05:46.850 --> 00:05:48.520
Such a thing happened...?

00:05:48.520 --> 00:05:50.860
What her eyes reflected...

00:05:50.860 --> 00:05:56.730
It wasn't me. She only saw a hated enemy, the Golden Knight.

00:05:56.730 --> 00:06:01.040
Even so... Even so, I can't believe it!

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:03.000
That Seimei would...

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:05.060
I feel the same way.

00:06:06.910 --> 00:06:08.680
Is that...?

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:11.010
A summons from the Watchdog Center.

00:06:11.010 --> 00:06:12.280
Take care of things here.

00:06:12.280 --> 00:06:15.220
Huh? U-Um, Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:06:15.220 --> 00:06:18.020
Even if you ask me to do something like that...

00:06:18.850 --> 00:06:22.560
A Madou tool in the shape of a human...

00:06:22.560 --> 00:06:28.230
U-Um, please bear with a shabby place like this for now.

00:06:28.230 --> 00:06:29.390
Yes.

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:37.240
So the seal was a Madou tool in the shape of a human.

00:06:37.240 --> 00:06:39.940
No wonder it couldn't be found!

00:06:39.940 --> 00:06:43.610
And it cannot use its original power?

00:06:43.610 --> 00:06:48.420
So she is useless until Rudra resurrects.

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:53.090
We cannot depend on such questionable power.

00:06:53.090 --> 00:06:55.580
If that is the case, Raiko...

00:06:57.090 --> 00:06:59.230
Are you listening, Raiko?

00:06:59.230 --> 00:07:01.500
Y-Yes!

00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:05.460
It seems your heart is flustered by the event with Seimei.

00:07:08.640 --> 00:07:12.570
Attack! Attack Seimei and eliminate Rudra!

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:14.680
That was the order given to you!

00:07:14.680 --> 00:07:17.610
Seimei is Rudra's vessel.

00:07:17.610 --> 00:07:21.280
It is what must be done in order to stop the resurrection of Rudra.

00:07:21.280 --> 00:07:24.990
You should already understand, Raiko!

00:07:24.990 --> 00:07:26.250
Don't run away.

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:27.960
Do not look away.

00:07:27.960 --> 00:07:31.930
You must uphold your duty, Golden Knight!

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:35.450
Golden Knight!
I will definitely kill you next time!

00:07:37.170 --> 00:07:39.030
You are overthinking things.

00:07:39.030 --> 00:07:44.640
There is no way Raiko-<i>sama</i> thinks of you as troublesome.

00:07:44.640 --> 00:07:46.270
But...

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:49.480
He is so different from before.

00:07:49.480 --> 00:07:52.550
I feel it is difficult to approach him...

00:07:52.550 --> 00:07:55.280
He is currently confused.

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:57.320
Truthfully, so am I.

00:07:57.320 --> 00:08:01.820
Too many things have happened all at once...

00:08:01.820 --> 00:08:04.130
The Horror of the Crimson Moon awakened,

00:08:04.130 --> 00:08:09.700
our friends were attacked one after another, you suddenly appeared,

00:08:09.700 --> 00:08:11.460
and, most of all...

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:20.210
Stop!

00:08:20.210 --> 00:08:22.070
Don't go near there!

00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:25.210
Oh. Um!

00:08:25.210 --> 00:08:29.850
The housemate who lives there is currently away.

00:08:29.850 --> 00:08:32.550
You mean, Seimei-<i>sama</i>?

00:08:36.990 --> 00:08:38.530
I see.

00:08:38.530 --> 00:08:41.260
Inari-<i>sama</i> said things like that...

00:08:41.260 --> 00:08:44.660
What... What should I do?

00:08:46.700 --> 00:08:49.340
H-How is the temperature of the water?

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:51.740
Yes, it is warm.

00:08:51.740 --> 00:08:54.080
That's good!

00:08:54.080 --> 00:08:57.780
Kaguya-<i>san</i> is actually pretty charming!

00:08:57.780 --> 00:09:00.050
She isn't really a princess that enraptures aristocrats or

00:09:00.050 --> 00:09:04.720
a dangerous Madou tool that suddenly uses scary spells.

00:09:04.720 --> 00:09:07.120
Thank goodness for that!

00:09:07.120 --> 00:09:08.190
Kintoki.

00:09:08.190 --> 00:09:09.120
Yes?

00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:11.360
Don't force yourself to act cheerfully.

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:13.020
It's too blatant.

00:09:13.930 --> 00:09:18.230
Kaguya, I want to confirm one thing.

00:09:18.230 --> 00:09:19.570
Yes.

00:09:19.570 --> 00:09:24.910
You once said you were waiting for someone to save you.

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:28.040
However, you said it wasn't me.

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:30.640
So why did you come to me again?

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:34.780
Sadness is not abandon.

00:09:35.950 --> 00:09:39.450
Last night, I felt a sudden pain.

00:09:39.450 --> 00:09:45.930
The moment that pain shot through my body, I remembered these words.

00:09:45.930 --> 00:09:50.100
And, before I realized it, you were before me.

00:09:50.100 --> 00:09:53.940
Sadness is not abandon... What does that mean?

00:09:53.940 --> 00:09:57.410
Does it have something to do with Rudra's seal?

00:09:57.410 --> 00:09:59.340
That is what I hope.

00:09:59.340 --> 00:10:02.570
I wish to remember quickly as well.

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:06.140
About myself...

00:10:08.650 --> 00:10:11.790
The red lightning that attacked the Light Palace

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:15.860
has caused a lot of damage within the capital.

00:10:15.860 --> 00:10:19.530
Everyone fears it is a sign of the end of this world.

00:10:19.530 --> 00:10:24.370
Many people, both commoners and aristocrats, have fled the capital.

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:27.600
Please show everyone the way!

00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:32.170
Words from Michinaga-<i>sama</i> would strengthen everyone's hearts!

00:10:32.170 --> 00:10:33.870
I will think about it.

00:10:33.870 --> 00:10:35.840
No, time is of the essence!

00:10:35.840 --> 00:10:37.510
Leave!

00:10:37.510 --> 00:10:40.380
I must now meet with a guest.

00:10:40.380 --> 00:10:41.940
I will return to my mansion.

00:10:48.790 --> 00:10:52.850
This light will soon turn to darkness as well.

00:11:03.240 --> 00:11:04.800
So you have come.

00:11:10.240 --> 00:11:13.410
I am truly honored by the invitation.

00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:17.940
I am glad you responded to the invitation.

00:11:29.730 --> 00:11:33.360
So you will not accept my hospitalities.

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:37.840
Tell me what you want.

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:41.510
Why did you kill the previous Ashiya Douman?

00:11:41.510 --> 00:11:46.110
He was not the darkness
I yearned for. That's all.

00:11:46.110 --> 00:11:49.220
So you toss aside anything you cannot use?

00:11:49.220 --> 00:11:50.850
What are you trying to say?

00:11:50.850 --> 00:11:53.880
You do the same, Michinaga.

00:11:57.390 --> 00:12:02.200
Though I depended much on Haruaki, he is no longer useful.

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:04.870
Man cannot fight age.

00:12:04.870 --> 00:12:08.370
I have come to realize there is a limit to Haruaki's power.

00:12:08.370 --> 00:12:11.270
So you want me to serve you instead?

00:12:11.270 --> 00:12:14.280
No, I will not ask you to serve me.

00:12:14.280 --> 00:12:19.610
I believe you should join me.

00:12:19.610 --> 00:12:25.010
Just how much do you know, Michinaga?

00:12:59.480 --> 00:13:02.120
You were the one tossed away.

00:13:02.120 --> 00:13:03.780
That is all there is.

00:13:03.780 --> 00:13:05.050
Yes.

00:13:05.050 --> 00:13:09.560
Just because of that, the things we desire are completely different.

00:13:09.560 --> 00:13:12.090
Is it truly that different?

00:13:12.090 --> 00:13:16.800
Light or darkness. Does it really matter?

00:13:16.800 --> 00:13:19.630
Both cannot exist without the other.

00:13:19.630 --> 00:13:21.970
Are you really saying that to me?

00:13:21.970 --> 00:13:24.640
No, that should be expected of you.

00:13:24.640 --> 00:13:28.310
I will ask once, sibling.

00:13:28.310 --> 00:13:33.480
Will you join me and run this capital by my side?

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:42.520
This is not even worth talking about.

00:13:42.520 --> 00:13:45.460
I wish for darkness.

00:13:45.460 --> 00:13:49.830
I see everything in a different light than you.

00:13:49.830 --> 00:13:53.370
I wish to see the light in this Light Palace...

00:13:53.370 --> 00:13:59.370
No, this world, be swallowed by darkness until it becomes darkness itself.

00:13:59.370 --> 00:14:02.710
I will watch there as you despair.

00:14:02.710 --> 00:14:07.720
Light is something that people who do not know true despair cling upon.

00:14:07.720 --> 00:14:11.720
It is a fleeting thing that gets swallowed by great darkness.

00:14:11.720 --> 00:14:15.960
I see. Then, why did you respond to my invitation?

00:14:15.960 --> 00:14:19.730
I came to peer at the darkness within you.

00:14:19.730 --> 00:14:23.030
Though it seems that was a mistake.

00:14:23.030 --> 00:14:28.040
You try to keep your hands untainted and white.

00:14:28.040 --> 00:14:31.240
You and I are truly different in every way.

00:14:31.240 --> 00:14:34.340
Yes, I will not be swallowed by the darkness.

00:14:34.340 --> 00:14:36.210
I will not become a Horror, either.

00:14:36.210 --> 00:14:37.980
Then you should stay pure,

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:41.380
only to be hunted by the darkness and disappear.

00:14:49.690 --> 00:14:52.520
Goodness, I really can't handle this.

00:14:53.560 --> 00:14:57.900
Raiko-<i>sama</i> doesn't pay attention to Kaguya-<i>san</i> at all.

00:14:57.900 --> 00:15:00.730
Be it day or night, the only thing he thinks about is Seimei.

00:15:00.730 --> 00:15:03.670
Even I can't stand it.

00:15:03.670 --> 00:15:05.570
Life is so fleeting.

00:15:05.570 --> 00:15:07.460
But, can it be helped?

00:15:07.460 --> 00:15:12.580
Seimei-<i>chan</i> became the vessel and he has to punish her for it?

00:15:12.580 --> 00:15:16.520
Raiko-<i>chan</i> isn't the type to follow an order like that so easily.

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:18.290
That's true, but...

00:15:18.290 --> 00:15:22.520
And that's why you care for him so much, right?

00:15:22.520 --> 00:15:25.360
He's stubborn and doesn't listen,

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:29.300
but he's pure and straight as an arrow until the end.

00:15:29.300 --> 00:15:30.360
Well...

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:35.940
And I know that you're really worried about Seimei yourself.

00:15:35.940 --> 00:15:41.110
But you never show it on your face, for the sake of your master.

00:15:41.110 --> 00:15:43.040
Aren't I right?

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:47.950
I hope the day you two can laugh again comes soon,

00:15:47.950 --> 00:15:51.420
together with Seimei-<i>chan.</i>

00:15:51.420 --> 00:15:53.910
Is it all right if I cry a bit?

00:15:55.090 --> 00:15:56.420
It'll be all right.

00:15:56.420 --> 00:15:59.090
No matter how much he thinks and wanders,

00:15:59.090 --> 00:16:01.760
he will come back to where he belongs.

00:16:01.760 --> 00:16:03.730
That is Raiko-<i>chan.</i>

00:16:14.070 --> 00:16:17.110
You are Seimei's...

00:16:17.110 --> 00:16:18.940
She's calling for me.

00:16:46.110 --> 00:16:47.470
Seimei!

00:16:48.640 --> 00:16:51.480
You really came.

00:16:51.480 --> 00:16:54.450
I see. This is a convenient tool.

00:16:54.450 --> 00:16:58.010
Seimei, have you really been taken over by Rudra?!

00:17:13.670 --> 00:17:16.070
Shit! What should I do?

00:17:25.380 --> 00:17:28.140
Huh? Raiko-<i>sama</i>?

00:17:31.250 --> 00:17:32.720
Huh?!

00:17:36.720 --> 00:17:39.060
Such an uninteresting enemy.

00:17:39.060 --> 00:17:41.290
Are you truly the Golden Knight?

00:17:46.070 --> 00:17:49.070
I was unsure.

00:17:49.070 --> 00:17:53.010
Golden Knight, once I kill you...

00:17:53.010 --> 00:17:55.710
I almost forgot my duty...

00:17:55.710 --> 00:18:00.410
There will be nothing in the way of my resurrection!

00:18:00.410 --> 00:18:01.920
That's why, I should just...

00:18:01.920 --> 00:18:06.290
Once my power is restored,
I will bring darkness to this world.

00:18:06.290 --> 00:18:07.780
Shut up!

00:18:09.460 --> 00:18:12.090
You are Rudra!

00:18:15.560 --> 00:18:20.130
And so, I will defeat you!

00:18:28.780 --> 00:18:31.210
You have finally gotten serious.

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:49.220
You are good.

00:18:59.640 --> 00:19:01.470
Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:19:07.650 --> 00:19:10.850
Seimei... Raiko-<i>sama...</i>

00:19:37.310 --> 00:19:39.150
Kaguya-<i>san</i>!

00:19:39.150 --> 00:19:43.490
Raiko-<i>sama</i>, you must not fight her!

00:19:45.990 --> 00:19:48.110
If you defeat her now...

00:19:50.190 --> 00:19:53.360
Anger is not hatred.

00:19:53.360 --> 00:19:58.330
--Sadness is not abandon.

00:19:53.360 --> 00:19:55.330
--Shut up! Quiet!

00:19:55.330 --> 00:19:58.330
--You pesky woman! Stop! Stop!

00:19:58.330 --> 00:20:00.360
Stop spouting your nonsense!

00:20:01.870 --> 00:20:04.070
Disappear. Disappear.

00:20:04.070 --> 00:20:05.810
You do not exist!

00:20:05.810 --> 00:20:10.470
This body is already mine!

00:20:19.190 --> 00:20:20.350
Shit!

00:20:20.350 --> 00:20:26.160
What... What is going on with me?

00:20:26.160 --> 00:20:29.700
She should have disappeared completely.

00:20:29.700 --> 00:20:31.890
So why?!

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:37.340
Silver Knight, have your wounds somewhat recovered?

00:20:37.340 --> 00:20:41.940
Yeah. I'm not at my best, but I'm fine.

00:20:41.940 --> 00:20:44.180
Oh, that is good.

00:20:45.580 --> 00:20:48.580
You didn't call me here because you were worried about my injuries.

00:20:48.580 --> 00:20:50.280
Get straight to the point.

00:20:50.280 --> 00:20:53.690
You're an impatient man, as usual.

00:20:54.720 --> 00:20:57.190
Silver Knight Zanga.

00:20:57.190 --> 00:21:02.360
I order you. Attack Seimei, who has become Rudra's vessel.

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:07.030
Rudra is a Horror that has immense power.

00:21:07.030 --> 00:21:12.040
Who knows how many casualties we'll have after resurrection.

00:21:12.040 --> 00:21:18.050
You must attack before the people you must protect are harmed.

00:21:18.050 --> 00:21:20.380
Eliminate Seimei!

00:21:54.280 --> 00:22:02.210
<i>Whilst looking at the filling moon</i>

00:22:02.210 --> 00:22:12.190
<i>Today, as well, I bury these growing feelings</i>

00:22:12.300 --> 00:22:19.340
<i>The skies of fate have split in two</i>

00:22:19.340 --> 00:22:25.340
<i>(Shine upon the darkness) Lead me</i>

00:22:26.810 --> 00:22:31.690
<i>Yearning for the light, I throw out my heart</i>

00:22:31.690 --> 00:22:36.820
<i>I will always be beside you</i>

00:22:36.820 --> 00:22:43.460
<i>So until the last moment of this life</i>

00:22:43.460 --> 00:22:48.660
<i>Let me see this fleeting dream</i>

00:22:54.540 --> 00:22:57.640
You have my thanks, Kaguya.

00:22:57.640 --> 00:23:03.180
If you didn't come,
I would have cut Seimei down.

00:23:03.180 --> 00:23:08.520
I would like to thank you as well.
I have remembered another line.

00:23:08.520 --> 00:23:10.520
So now we have two parts...

00:23:10.520 --> 00:23:13.330
Sadness is not abandon.

00:23:13.330 --> 00:23:16.830
Anger is not hatred.

00:23:16.830 --> 00:23:20.400
I believe these words to be related to Rudra...

00:23:20.400 --> 00:23:23.440
Or the seal of the Crimson Moon.

00:23:23.440 --> 00:23:26.910
It's true that I have felt anger and sadness.

00:23:26.910 --> 00:23:30.610
However, I feel no hatred and I have not given up.

00:23:30.610 --> 00:23:32.880
You understand, right?

00:23:32.880 --> 00:23:36.720
The way she responded in pain...

00:23:36.720 --> 00:23:39.210
It's proof that Seimei hasn't disappeared yet.

00:23:42.020 --> 00:23:44.560
Seimei is alive.

00:23:44.560 --> 00:23:47.260
I will be sure to save her!

00:23:50.990 --> 00:24:01.000
"Next Episode: DUEL"

00:23:52.290 --> 00:23:54.160
Crisscrossing light.

00:23:54.160 --> 00:23:56.860
Now is the time to ask your heart.

00:23:56.860 --> 00:24:00.700
For what reason do you wield your blade?
